      "snippet": "COVID-19 is the name of the disease caused by the SARS-CoV2 virus. Viruses and the diseases they cause have different names. For example, AIDS is the disease caused by the human immunodeficiency virus (HIV). COVID-19 is an acronym. In its full form, COVID-19 stands for COronaVIrus Disease of 2019.",
